OL,3,ALetby 'boyfriend' doctor named as court
OL,4,Aorder lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeakin, who was married and had
OL,7,Fchildren, continued his medical career
OL,8,Fafter leaving the Countess of Chester,
OL,9,Flater working as a consultant at Alder
OL,10,FHey Children's Hospital in Liverpool.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
